'' TKO1150: an Optional's Value( ) or a Result's Value( ) / Failure( ) that no HasValue( ) /
'' IsOk( ) check covers on every path (symbols/semoptcheck.tiko). Warns, in Warns( ), on each
'' line its source marks; is silent over every guarded form in Guarded( ): a branch, '= false',
'' 'andalso', 'orelse', 'iif', a 'while', an else arm, an 'elseif', assignment from Some( ),
'' Assign( ), nested ifs, and early 'return' / 'error' / 'end'. A byref parameter, const or not,
'' is tracked as a byval one is. A copy of a tracked variable takes its facts; an fbc-style
'' 'assert_' macro (calling fb_Assert, which ends the program) is a check; a closure's body is
'' not judged.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --frontend-only tests/diagnostics/src/optional-unchecked.tiko
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
